From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v0lumehi <aljic.zijad@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:23:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] NSP script: a package with no ticket and no [title ID] in its
 name gives its title ID from its own meta NCA

title_of took the title ID only from the ticket's file name or a [title ID] tag in the file name. With neither, it now asks nx_extract --title, which reads the meta NCA's header with the keys' header_key.

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#666
Reason: an NSP without a ticket and without a title ID tag stops the build until upstream merges the fallback
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#177
